+### Urgent Founder intake on Phoebe
+
+Install the **separate** `viche-intake` S6 service alongside (not instead of) the existing `viche` service. Its `run` template lives at `deploy/s6/viche-intake/run`. The persistent host-managed service is `/etc/services.d/viche-intake/run`, with `VICHE_TOWNHALL_ID=297` exported before the template's environment check. S6 supervises it through `/run/service/viche-intake`. It loads the POSIX Guix profile and invokes `government/intake-watch.sh` every `VICHE_FOUNDER_POLL_SECONDS` (default 60 seconds).
+
+It must **not** replace or modify the Founder-controlled read-only `constitution/boot.sh`, and must not accelerate ordinary ten-minute sittings or introduce direct OpenCode invocations. Intake consults Antonina's Town Hall pages and activity feed, and maintains crash-resilient `pending/`, `sent/`, `ack/`, and cursors under `$VICHE_STATE_ROOT/founder-inbox`. A running clerk is steered via `antonina agent run --steer --detach`; an idle or failed clerk is started normally. Sent events without durable acknowledgement are redelivered after ten minutes. Do not delete this queue during restarts or routine cleanup; the Janitor Office must protect it.
+
+Validate with `dash tests/intake-smoke.sh`, check S6 status, post a real Founder comment on #297, and confirm that the corresponding event becomes `sent` and a concrete triage acknowledgement is recorded. CI green alone does not prove that the live endpoint works.
